Node ID=240 ahriman gone
Text=You...you are right. I have sensed it for some time. Both Ahriman and Ahura Mazda have...departed. But to have the struggle decided by...*humans*? Neither their hearts nor their minds are fit to decide the fate of creation. No, *I* will complete the Disjunction and fill the void left by Ahriman.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Skills/Speech/Speech moreequal 180
}
Reply Text=Your arrogance has allowed the lies to blind you. Your true master, Ahura Mazda, wanted humankind to choose freely between the truth and lies. In the end, the truth must win.
Go to node ID=250 become truth
Action work in progress=(speech >180)
