Node ID=241 ahriman going EVIL
Text=You...you may be right. I have sensed a deep gnawing, as if I was being slowly digested from the inside out. Both Ahriman and Ahura Mazda have...departed and left me with an empty shell. But to fight alone, and without guidance...No, *I* will complete the Disjunction and fill the void left by Ahriman!
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Skills/Speech/Speech moreequal 180
}
Reply Text=The void *has* been filled...by me. As the scion of Lionheart, the depth of my evil power will know no bounds. Your true master, Ahura Mazda, knew that this day would come and that I would someday reign as Dark Lord. In the end, the lie will prevail.
