Node ID=251 become the LIE
Text=Your soul does shine so very darkly...and what you say has a dreaded ring of truth. How my hollow soul does echo with its lamentations! But my task of domination, the ritual...if I have been forsaken, then the stress of channeling may be too great...
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=There is another way. Come into me, and together, we shall squash the dreaded forces of light and truth. Your soul shall know peace and fulfillment once again.
