Node ID=500 Evil Ending All Die or Live
Text=<A dark, ethereal voice surrounds you> You think you have won? That you have become the darkness, Ahriman's chosen? Though you have slain the Old Man of the Mountain, *I* survive to find another host strong enough to bear my power. The struggle will not end.
