Node ID=510 Good Ending All Dead
Text=<A dark, ethereal voice surrounds you> You have won, but at what cost? It pleases me that DaVinci and Galileo have joined me in darkness. Soon you will find that others succeeded and restored my master. One day Ahriman will return!
